Z||000000||Jefrysuko||09-30-2001||04:50 PM||||I decided to decipher my RPO codes today and of course have a few that I am confused by.<P><B>88 GT</B><P><B>YF5</B> - <BR><B>662</B> - <I>Seat material?</I><BR><B>669</B> - <I>Seat material?</I><BR><B>VG8</B> - <I>Radiator?</I><BR><B>XEM</B> -<BR><B>66I</B> - <I>Seat material?</I><BR><B>E9Z</B> -<BR><B>YLM</B> - P215/60 R15 BSW STL (FRONT) W/P215/60 R15 BSW STL (rear)<BR><B>D9C</B> - Gear, speedometer drive (C) 35 teeth 94408341<BR><B>D4P</B> - Gear, speedometer driven (P) 30 teeth 25519845 (blue)<P>Shouldn't <B>YLM</B> be 205/60 front, 215/60 rear and which gear do I have 30 or 35 tooth?<P><B>86 SE</B><P><B>YF5</B> -<BR><B>629</B> - <I>Seat material?</I><BR><B>62I</B> - <I>Seat material?</I><BR><B>VJ9</B> - <I>Radiator?</I><P>Thanks<BR>Jeffrey<P>------------------<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/fullstaff.gif">   <p>[This message has been edited by Jefrysuko (edited 09-30-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000001||Hank is Here||09-30-2001||06:11 PM||||YF5	CERTIFICATION, EMISSION, CALIFORNIA<BR>662	TRIM COMBINATION, LEATHER, MEDIUM BEECHWOOD<BR>669	SEATBELT COLOR, MEDIUM BEECHWOOD<BR>VG8	VEHICLE, BUYER NOTICE LABEL<BR>XEM	TIRE, P205/60R15, GOODYEAR EAGLE GT+4, BLACKWALL, FRONT<BR>66I	INTERIOR TRIM, MEDIUM BEECHWOOD<BR>E9Z	SPEEDOMETER GEARS, LESS KEYS<BR>YLM	TIRE, P215/60R15, GOODYEAR EAGLE GT+4, BLACKWALL, REAR<BR>629	SEATBELT COLOR, LIGHT SADDLE<BR>62I	INTERIOR TRIM, LIGHT SADDLE<BR>VJ9	LABEL, EMISSION, COMPLIANCE, CALIFORNIA<P><BR>Any questions?||||reg||1
